        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Davey Brozowski, Brian Standeford, Leo Gebhardt, Jiancarlo Cateriano\n- Organizations: Modest Mouse, Tall Birds, Catheters\n- Places: Issaquah, Washington, Seattle, Portland, Oregon\n- Roles: percussionist\n\nFacts:\n- Modest Mouse is an American rock band that was formed in 1992 in Issaquah, Washington, a suburb of Seattle, and is currently based in Portland, Oregon.\n- Tall Birds was formed in 2005 and consisted of former Catheters members Brian Standeford, Davey Brozowski, and Leo Gebhardt, along with bassist Jiancarlo Cateriano.\n- Davey Brozowski currently tours with Modest Mouse as the band's percussionist.",
